+## Unreleased
+
+* Windows: optional virtual HID mouse (WinUHid) for relative
+  (`performMouseMoveRelative` / `mouseMoveR`) and absolute
+  (`performMouseMoveAbsl` / `mouseMoveA`) injection. Absolute report uses
+  virtual-desktop 0..65535 (multi-monitor ready). SendInput stays default with
+  SHORT-range split hardening. MethodChannel:
+  `setMouseInputBackend`, `getMouseInputBackend`, `getEffectiveMouseInputBackend`,
+  `isVhidMouseAvailable`.
+
